From aa80dd2a01561d5f0b7ae360dddbe1fb9d569388 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWorlds <openworlds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:23:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] RandomAccessFile and FileChannel locks

RandomAccessFile was a stub that threw: now on C stdio, with the JDK's
DataInput/DataOutput (big-endian, readLine taking bytes as Latin-1,
modified UTF-8) and getChannel(). The channel's tryLock/lock use flock()
(always granted on the Vita, where one program runs at a time); FileLock
added.
